\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 "There are multiple different types of equations to estimate the GFR, which is what really tells us how well the kidney is filtering," Yau explains. "That GFR equation is stratified based on your age. What might be a normal creatinine and reflect a normal GFR for a person who is 20 years old may be different, or a not-so-worrisome creatinine, in a person who's 80 years old may reflect a lower GFR." }
